# The HSE final-mesh static, passed to the HSE stage (vasp-relax-static-coarse)
# as its INCAR.final. The electronic settings are that runner's INCAR.final
# plus the HSE06 tags of the endpoint-pbe-hse campaign (ALGO Damped, LHFCALC,
# AEXX 0.25, HFSCREEN 0.2, TIME 0.4, ISYM 3; notebook log 2026-10-15-0955).
# PRECFOCK comes from final_incar_tags (Normal). The runner sets NSW=0,
# IBRION=-1, ISIF=2, LWAVE, EDIFF=final_ediff and ISTART/ICHARG. Compound
# settings (ENCUT, ENAUG, NBANDS) go in the job's incar_tags.
LCHARG=.FALSE.
LORBIT=11
LMAXMIX=6

ISPIN=2

ALGO=Damped
TIME=0.4
LHFCALC=.TRUE.
AEXX=0.25
HFSCREEN=0.2
PREC=Accurate
ENCUT=600
ENAUG=900
LREAL=Auto
LASPH=.TRUE.
ADDGRID=.FALSE.
ISYM=3
SYMPREC=1e-4

ISMEAR=-5

NELMIN=5
NELM=200
